<p></p>
<h1 id=3D"AppStatusFeatureSheet-FeatureSummary"><span style=3D"color:#8590a=
2;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Feature Summary</span>&nbsp;</span></h1>
<ol>
 <li><span>Application status provides clients a real-time &amp; consolidat=
ed view of system events impacting applications within the NBIN ecosystem a=
nd ability to monitor these events within CX&nbsp;</span>
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"ecce180d-1be5-4ed4-9224-b348ca263b73"><span>Bugs or Inc=
idents</span></li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"3a2933da-b7e0-4582-893f-340eddabf75f"><span>Planned Mai=
ntenance</span></li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"47783313-5164-42b5-b797-7f9f77f98328"><span>NBIN support =
teams can effectively communicate the system status and event details withi=
n new Compass and thereby reducing inbound inquiries for clients.</span>
  <ol>
   <li data-uuid=3D"b1c1196a-11dc-42e7-b80b-2588e2ecb1bf"><span>Start and r=
esolution details</span></li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"61350444-ceba-4700-8f03-f9304e530ffa">Feature or applic=
ations impacted</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"3e3eb5a1-deba-4196-99b3-31c968876ead">Event updates and=
 workarounds (if any)</li>
  </ol></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"673be9db-4a66-4a8a-aa02-9996938b6b4e">CX users will now r=
eceived real time in-app notifications for new system status events.</li>
</ol>
<p><br></p>
<p><span style=3D"font-size: 24.0px;letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Key Benefits<=
/span></p>
<ul style=3D"text-align: left;">
 <li data-uuid=3D"f8725f0b-42bf-40ff-b24a-6a163fe2afc6">
  <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><span>Benefits to NBIN</span></p>
  <ul class=3D"" style=3D"text-align: left;">
   <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"1703f77c-b7ba-=
43a6-b345-ad049fe887ee">
    <p class=3D""><span>R2 decom - Feature allows us to decom the existing =
R2 traffic lights feature</span></p></li>
   <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"f15146f9-7e83-=
4bd0-b5ba-d3f65e0dc946">
    <p class=3D""><span>Operational Efficiency: Reduce manual efforts that =
service and support teams spend on responding to client queries due to exis=
ting R2 traffic lights limitations and existing user experience.</span></p>=
</li>
   <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"7a8fad1d-d3ef-=
4f65-9a26-9baffc1b82bd">
    <p class=3D""><span>Improved Communication: Users can view real time up=
dates about status updates and system health for</span></p></li>
   <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"12d0359a-10c6-=
4840-baeb-83362291a921">
    <p class=3D""><span>Trust and Engagement: Enables transparent communica=
tion and encourages continued interaction with CX resulting in increased ad=
option</span></p></li>
   <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"72e38538-8823-=
4e9d-b961-31e4d9fd3c0b">
    <p class=3D""><span>Enablement: New capability for communicating system=
 issues &amp; release downtimes for new Compass features. Currently the sam=
e is done through email.</span></p></li>
  </ul>
  <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><br></p></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"9658a40b-fdef-46be-8a3c-0be6e74512d8">
  <p style=3D"text-align: left;"><span>Benefits to Users</span></p>
  <ul class=3D"" style=3D"text-align: left;">
   <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"3d38d150-21ce-=
4fd7-9741-e5b5f6d9b947">
    <p class=3D""><span>User Experience: Improved experience as users will =
be able to view details of active incidents for all applications in one vie=
w&nbsp;</span></p></li>
   <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"0e93c24d-5da7-=
4972-9e92-63ea37b9f3f7">
    <p class=3D""><span>Task Efficiency:</span></p>
    <ul class=3D"">
     <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"114c458f-1f5=
4-400d-8a58-6ae4a9ba07d8">
      <p class=3D""><span>Users will be able to view Application status in =
CX thereby reducing the additional effort of navigating to R2 to view traff=
ic lights of features and applications available in R2.</span></p></li>
     <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"607eca3a-3d3=
6-4425-929a-93fef64148cd">
      <p class=3D""><span>Users will be able to review the application stat=
us for new Compass features on the platform and will reduce the reliance on=
 email communication from Prod Support or on communication from their firm =
admins.</span></p></li>
     <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"a0c7a7c5-4f7=
5-43de-9190-306174d4d4a9">
      <p class=3D""><span>More clarity on issues reducing the need for user=
s to communicate with service teams to understand workarounds for system&nb=
sp; issues.</span></p></li>
    </ul></li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h1 id=3D"AppStatusFeatureSheet-FeatureScope">Feature Scope</h1>
<h2 id=3D"AppStatusFeatureSheet-InScope">In Scope</h2>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f12a2c9b-b62c-45f6-9221-8fff1af7697c">Events types=20
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"ef335441-efb9-4960-8606-e24e1901736f">Incidents or bugs=
</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"324dd53b-4d8d-4220-9cf1-34528daf8b7a">Planned maintenan=
ce</li>
  </ul></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"91d1da97-c0b2-4f51-a320-d626edd72c2f">Applications and fe=
atures for which events can be created and communicated=20
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"c9ae4f5f-4ef9-4605-b410-4fbe9f1f73b5">All features, int=
egrations, applications &amp; IIS tools within CX</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"c6ce31d3-15fe-4734-a8df-f4939d067a28">All features, app=
lications &amp; integrations within R2</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"c33b5836-2b22-45a0-bb48-1ddbd428c7bc">All Infinite tool=
s</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"b8b17bc7-2bc1-4b03-88dd-cb07ae97d56e">Other application=
s - My Portfolio+, Netrep</li>
   <li data-uuid=3D"5f83de61-c76d-4b9f-ba19-68b137a53d4c">Other processes -=
 SFTP etc,</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h2 id=3D"AppStatusFeatureSheet-OutofScope">Out of Scope</h2>
<ul>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"904de341-cc69-42=
11-b66b-7447a6b9903e">
  <p><span>Email notifications for application status will be a separate fe=
ature.</span></p></li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"f0787199-2e9c-47=
61-9176-5aa4da88664a">
  <p><span>Application status is a view only feature and client firms will =
have to follow existing process for reporting issues.</span></p></li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"449c9c95-7bc6-45=
36-aede-18e5b0912705"><span>Existing process for support or incident resolu=
tion between the support, product &amp; delivery teams will continue as app=
lication status is only a communication tool</span></li>
 <li class=3D"fontSize-child paragraph-child" data-uuid=3D"b499d094-47fd-4f=
33-a482-31fccc624a80"><span>Existing process for internal reporting and ana=
lytics will continue and use of application status as analytics or tracking=
 tool is out of scope.</span></li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2c8fe29c-f9d0-4af1-bfba-d749732d96bc">Application status =
is not a public page and clients can view this feature only after they logi=
n to CX</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"c71530e6-4605-4b07-a54e-1fd771215fad">Banners or maintena=
nce on login page, maintenance page during actual downtimes is out of scope=
.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a60fb23a-b105-4027-84d5-8fab3d27dcad">Usage of planned ma=
intenance banners for other marketing or operational announcements is out o=
f scope.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a4b74b6b-3584-45af-811f-680e83a7a0d8">Event targeting bas=
is R2 user profile is out of scope.</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"0da046f3-49b1-41c4-bb6a-f3141838572a">Event history is ou=
t of scope and only active events or events resolved in the last 24hrs woul=
d be visible to clients on the System Health Events page</li>
</ul>
