<h3 id=3D"AppStatusFeatureSheet-Business&amp;ProductUseCases:">Business &am=
p; Product Use Cases :</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 69=
.4534%;">
  <colgroup class=3D"">
   <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 54.4646%;">
